### Is the server alive?
# @name root
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Health check
# @name health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### List challenges
# @name listChallenges
GET http://localhost:8080/api/challenges
Accept: application/json

### Get one challenge
# @name getChallenge
GET http://localhost:8080/api/challenges/1
Accept: application/json

### Challenge that doesn't exist
# @name getMissing
GET http://localhost:8080/api/challenges/67
Accept: application/json

### Bad id
# @name getBadId
GET http://localhost:8080/api/challenges/abc123
Accept: application/json


